  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> <strong>10,000 steps is about 4 to 5 miles (6.5&ndash;8&nbsp;km)</strong> for most adults. A typical walking step is 2.1 to 2.5&nbsp;feet, so 1&nbsp;mile is roughly 2,000 to 2,500 steps.</p></div>

